#: kmagzoomview.cpp:124
msgid ""
"This is the main window which shows the contents of the selected region. The "
"contents will be magnified according to the zoom level that is set."
msgstr ""
"यो चयन गरिएका क्षेत्रको सामाग्री देखाउने मुख्य सञ्झ्याल हो । सामाग्री जूम स्तर सेट गरिए "
"अनुरुप अभिवर्धन हुनेछन् ।"

#: main.cpp:39
msgid "File to open"
msgstr "खोल्नु पर्ने फाइल"

#: main.cpp:47 kmagselrect.cpp:208
